# SurgeGuard frontend - environment
#
# Copy to `.env.local` to override. Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the
# browser, and none of these is a secret: the interface holds no credentials.
# Sign-in state lives in an HttpOnly session cookie set by the backend.

# Where the Vite dev server (and `npm run preview`) proxies /api and /ws. The
# browser always talks to its own origin, so cookies, the Command Center socket
# and the video streams work identically in development and production.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Dev server port. 5180 by default (5173 is often taken by another Vite app);
# fixed with strictPort, so a clash fails loudly instead of moving silently.
# VITE_PORT=5180
